            "detailed_description": "This game is 2D open world RPG.<br />\r\nYou will advance games by clearing quests that occur in towns and others.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle is a turn-based battle of symbol encounter.<br />\r\nWhen you defeat an enemy, experience value is obtained,<br />\r\nand the character is strengthened by level up.<br />\r\nYou can buy items and equipment with money you got from enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBesides battle, you can enjoy various contents such as fishing,<br />\r\ncooking, marriage, furniture arrangement, theater, casino.<br />\r\nThe story is to destroy the Satan and save the world,<br />\r\nbut you can destroy the world with monsters as devil.<br />\r\nIt is the freedom of the player how to advance the story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOperation is done with the keyboard or Xbox 360 controller.<br />\r\nYou can save on the menu screen by pressing Enter (Start).",
